<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Priyabrata Sen about Age Difference Calculator, its calculation method or published guides.">
  <header class="page-heading wrap"><h1>Contact</h1><p>Questions, corrections and thoughtful suggestions are welcome.</p></header>
  <article class="prose-page wrap">
    <div class="contact-box">
      <h2>Email Priyabrata Sen</h2>
      <p>You can write to <a href="mailto:vickysen126@gmail.com">vickysen126@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <h2>Reporting a calculation issue</h2>
    <p>Please include the two dates you used, the result you expected and the browser or device involved. Do not send private identity documents.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
